ation. d. COLLABORATION : across disciplines and with all partners. e. EXCELLENCE : in all we do. Special Event Expectations: Participation and assistance is expected at major campus special events, such as commencement. Posting Information Posting Number SP00486 Posting Date 08/10/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants Job Duties Job Duties Percent of total time 100 Duties Recruitment and Outreach (40%): ● Manage an assigned recruitment territory by developing strategic relationships, executing recruitment plans, and meeting established recruitment and enrollment goals. ● Execute recruitment strategies that increase awareness of Kettering University and strengthen partnerships throughout the assigned recruitment territory. ● Meet individually with prospective students and families. ● Present information sessions to large and small groups. ● Utilize Slate and other enrollment technologies to manage the recruitment territory, document student interactions, schedule follow-up communications, and maintain accurate prospective student records. ● Conduct personalized outreach to prospective students through phone, email, text messaging, virtual appointments, and other communication channels. Application Evaluation (40%): ● Evaluate applications for admission. ● Serve as a resource for students, families, and counselors regarding admission policies and procedures. ● Provide referrals for students needing additional support services. Program Planning and Execution (20%): ● Assist in the planning, preparation, execution, and evaluation of recruitment programs and special projects. Volunteer Expectations: Participation and assistance are expected at major campus special events, such as commencement. Other duties as assigned. Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you willing to work occasional evenings and weekends? Yes N * Do you have a valid Driver's license? Yes No * Do you have the ability to travel frequently? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter List of References Optional Documents Kettering University, 1700 University Ave. Flint, MI 48504 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
