d Efficient Familiar with Microsoft 365 or Microsoft Office Computer literacy Good communicator (listening, speaking, and writing) Detail oriented Creative Friendly demeanor Moderate physical labor required Posting Information Posting Number SP00489 Posting Date 09/02/2026 Closing Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants This role is planned for an average of 20 hours a week. However, some weeks will require less hours, while others require more. Due to some evening or weekend events, the day to day schedule is flexible. Job Duties Job Duties Percent of total time 40 Duties Administrative Assistance to Robotics Center Staff Secure quotes Process orders Process marketing requests Campus room reservations Robotics Center Calendar integrated with Campus Events Secure meal vouchers for events Schedule campus tours for robotic events Other duties as assigned Percent of total time 10 Duties Robotics Pre-college Camps Prepare dates, camp descriptions, fees for Slate entry Track camp supply needs Secure dormitory rooms Secure meal vouchers Schedule activity providers Schedule campus tours Schedule admissions presentations Prepare RA’s and camp assistants Secure and print consent & release forms Other duties as assigned Percent of total time 30 Duties Robotic Event/Competition Support Secure needed volunteers Branded Kettering and sponsor signage is set up Opening ceremony includes sponsor videos, bios, etc. Secure hotel rooms for approved key volunteers Operate registration and recruitment tables Volunteer snacks, beverages, snack and meal vouchers, and coupons distributed Secure coffee and food trucks Assist with event set up and tear down Other duties as assigned Percent of total time 20 Duties Judge Advisor Role for Competitions Complete Judge Advisor training for VEX & RECF Assemble volunteer judges Hold virtual meeting for volunteer judges to review judging process Coordinate and operate remote judging of team notebooks Coordinate and operate in-person judging interviews and deliberations at the event Lead the awards presentation at events Other duties as assigned Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Cover Letter List of References Optional Documents Kettering University, 1700 University Ave. Flint, MI 48504 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
